00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:16.353
Anza na usafi wa mikono na ujitambulishe.

2
00:00:16.353 --> 00:00:22.020
Thibitisha utambulisho wa mgonjwa, kisha ueleze uchunguzi na upate kibali cha kuufanya.

3
