31
00:01:58.175 --> 00:02:01.760
Katika mmboni iliyepanuka, fovea inaweza kuonekana kuwa nyeusi kidogo

32
00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:04.060
ukanda wenye uakisi halisi.

33
00:02:04.060 --> 00:02:07.280
Rudia uchunguzi huu kwa jicho lingine.

34
00:02:07.280 --> 00:02:08.200
Baada ya

